  "slug": "spaetzle-ii",
  "name": "Spaetzle II",
  "recipe_type": null,
  "brief_description": "This easy recipe turns eggs and flour into a simple dumpling.",
  "cuisine": "German",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place flour in a medium bowl, making a well for the eggs. Introduce the eggs, and mix with a fork; then knead to form a stiff dough. Pinch off half-inch pieces of batter with fingers, and cook in a large pot of boiling water until dumplings float to the top, 5 to 15 minutes."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 4,
